			'Incluye dos rondas razonables de cambios durante boceto/WIP.',
			'El saldo se paga antes de entregar el archivo final en alta resolución.',
		]
	: [
			'Send a short description and references.',
			'We agree on scope, quote, and date.',
			'A 50% deposit reserves your slot and begins the work.',
			'You receive a sketch or WIP for approval.',
			'Two reasonable revisions are included during sketch/WIP.',
			'The balance is paid before the final high-resolution file is delivered.',
		];
