				'¿Cuándo respondes?',
				'Normalmente respondo de 8:00 a.m. a 6:00 p.m., hora central de Texas.',
			],
			[
				'¿Cuánto tarda?',
				'El tiempo habitual es de 2 a 4 semanas, según complejidad y fila de trabajo.',
			],
			[
				'¿Qué referencias necesitas?',
				'Imágenes del personaje, personalidad, pose, expresión, vestuario, paleta y ambiente ayudan mucho.',
			],
			[
				'¿Cuántos cambios incluye?',
				'Dos rondas razonables durante boceto o WIP; cambios grandes después de aprobar una etapa pueden requerir un cargo adicional.',
			],
			[
				'¿Incluye uso comercial?',
				'Los precios base cubren uso personal. Portadas, mercancía, publicidad, publicación o branding se cotizan según licencia y alcance.',
			],
			[
				'¿Qué archivo entregas?',
				'Una ilustración terminada en alta resolución; indica tamaño, formato o proporción antes de iniciar si la necesitas.',
			],
		]
	: [
			[
				'Do you use AI?',
				'The final piece is drawn and painted by me in Krita. I may consult auxiliary references for specific details, but they are never incorporated into the final artwork or used in place of drawing.',
			],
			[
				'Can you record a timelapse?',
				'Yes, for files under 3000 × 3000 px. For larger canvases I can share process screenshots instead.',
			],
			[
				'What are your response hours?',
				'I usually reply from 8:00 a.m. to 6:00 p.m., Texas Central Time.',
			],
			[
				'How long does delivery take?',
				'Typical turnaround is 2 to 4 weeks, depending on complexity and the queue.',
			],
			[
				'What references should I send?',
				'Character images, personality notes, pose, expression, outfit, palette, and mood or lighting references are helpful.',
			],
			[
				'How many revisions are included?',
				'Two reasonable rounds during sketch or WIP are included. Large changes after approval may need an extra fee.',
			],
			[
				'Can I use the illustration commercially?',
				'Base prices are for personal use. Covers, merchandise, advertising, publishing, and branding are quoted by license and scope.',
			],
			[
				'What file do you deliver?',
				'A finished high-resolution digital illustration. Tell me about required size, format, or ratio before we begin.',
			],
		];
// Edit projects here: set title, category (portrait/character/narrative/study), description,
